  stickyNoteInfos:
  - title: 'Offset Animation:'
    position:
      serializedVersion: 2
      x: -606
      y: 767
      width: 230
      height: 101
    contents: 'The spawnIndex is used to delay the start of the size and color attribute
      animations.

      This is what makes each letter appear one after the other.

'
    theme: 
    textSize: Small
    colorTheme: 2
  - title: 0-1 Line Sequencer
    position:
      serializedVersion: 2
      x: 8
      y: -601
      width: 310
      height: 218
    contents: "Calculating a normalized 0-1 spawnIndex for our particles is often
      very useful as it can be used to sample curves, distribute particles' size,
      position, etc.\n\r\nAs we're spawning 5 particles, the Spawn Index attribute
      will range from 0-4.\r\n\r\nNormalize 0-1 spawnIndex= spawn Index / (Number
      of particles - 1.0) \r\nThis 0-1 value is used in a line sequencer to distribute
      the particles along the line.\r\n"
    theme: 
    textSize: Small
    colorTheme: 2
  - title: Unity Font
    position:
      serializedVersion: 2
      x: 1006
      y: -1358
      width: 456
      height: 107
    contents: 
    theme: 
    textSize: Huge
    colorTheme: 2
  - title: Lightning
    position:
      serializedVersion: 2
      x: 3077
      y: -1303
      width: 408
      height: 107
    contents: 
    theme: 
    textSize: Huge
    colorTheme: 2
  - title: 'FlipBook Player:'
    position:
      serializedVersion: 2
      x: 3323
      y: 0
      width: 369
      height: 141
    contents: 'The Flipbook Player allows you to easily animate your flipbook or
      sprite sheet.

      Just give a frame rate and the block does the rest for
      you.

      In the background, this block is updating the texIndex value to
      animate the frame:

      texIndex +=  frameRate * delta Time ;

'
    theme: 
    textSize: Small
    colorTheme: 3
  - title: 'Double Outputs:'
    position:
      serializedVersion: 2
      x: 3035
      y: 594
      width: 213
      height: 100
    contents: The Lightning particles are rendered twice at two different box positions.
    theme: 
    textSize: Small
    colorTheme: 2
  - title: Global Spawn EVENT
    position:
      serializedVersion: 2
      x: 2445
      y: -2000
      width: 840
      height: 107
    contents: 
    theme: 
    textSize: Huge
    colorTheme: 2
  categories: []
  uiBounds:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: -631
    y: -2000
    width: 4348
    height: 4081
